From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Absolute-Confusion
 <290761898+Absolute-Confusion@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:06:49 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Crengine-Extended for KOReader 2026.07.1: per-category
 typography

Typography features used by the "Advanced Typography Settings" KOReader
plugin (advancedtypography.koplugin, in extended/), for 9 font categories
(unclassified, serif, sans-serif, cursive, fantasy, monospace, emoji,
fangsong, math):

- Font weight, slant type and text decoration weight per category;
  several text decorations at once (underline + line-through...).
- Unclassified category (css_ff_unclassified) for text with no generic
  font family, including font-family naming only specific fonts.
- Slant type per category (Italic, Oblique, synthetic): font faces are
  classified as fontconfig's FC_SLANT (fc-query) does, and slanted text
  uses the faces of the chosen kind only.
- Installed font families grouped by fontconfig's width and spacing (a
  width/spacing word is added only when a family mixes several values);
  former names stay usable for lookups.
- Installed fonts cache (cache/fontlist/crengine_fonts.dat): font files
  are only opened when used; the cache is only written when font files
  changed.

Base: crengine b32a88ffbbf505cf2ea5208c1a49002d70d3609f (KOReader 2026.07).
